%section.band.support
  .prose
    %h2 Keep makeabox running
    %p
      Thousands of boxes are drawn here every day, and have been since 2015. The site is free and has no ads.
      It does cost money to run, so if it saved you an evening, a donation of any size is appreciated.
    %form{action: 'https://www.paypal.com/cgi-bin/webscr', method: 'post', target: '_blank'}
      %input{name: 'cmd', type: 'hidden', value: '_s-xclick'}
      %input{name: 'hosted_button_id', type: 'hidden', value: 'Y4XR246KD644W'}
      %button.donate{type: 'submit'} Donate with PayPal
    %p.sign
      Konstantin Gredeskoul,
      %a{href: 'https://kig.re'} kig.re
